    "Chosen matte painted finish retained beside the native timber/forest surfaces.",
    "Rasmus ear occluders preserve the straw hat brim; tail and face stay clear of clothes.",
    "Pedro uses an opaque short shirt, woven hem band and paired leather tabs, with no human legs.",
    "Every idle/walk/run/reach frame is present; common deformation keeps layers registered.",
    "Far-side relaxed sword regions can be hidden by body/tail; dedicated attack arms remain a production task.",
    "The gallery uses a common transformed group; spin, altitude and tint do not separate cloth or hands."
